0..77 Comment "// The prefixes of a seat\'s protocol: the record of the moves a seat has made"
78..148 Comment "// so far, admitted while its run is still open, as a monitor checks a"
149..226 Comment "// session one message at a time (Bocchi, Chen, Demangeon, Honda and Yoshida,"
227..285 Comment "// _Monitoring Networks through Multiparty Session Types_,"
286..355 Comment "// doi:10.1016/j.tcs.2017.02.009). `Prefix(S)` holds every record the"
356..433 Comment "// protocol accepts so far, complete or not; `Run(S)` holds only the complete"
434..469 Comment "// ones (`./seat-evolution.gandr`)."
471..511 Comment "// The seat\'s protocol and its messages."
